# project: staff-engineer-hire-platform
VAR months_elapsed = 0
VAR negotiation_rounds = 0

=== sourcing_and_screening ===
Source and screen candidates for the platform team staff engineer role.
Done when the screen produces a strong panel pipeline for this month.
~ months_elapsed += 1
+ [Strong panel pipeline ready] -> panel_interviews
+ {months_elapsed < 3} [Keep sourcing another month] ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening
+ {months_elapsed >= 3} [Three months, no hirable candidate] -> rescope_review

=== rescope_review ===
Eng director revisits the role: keep searching for a staff engineer,
or re-scope to a senior contractor instead.
+ [Continue the staff search] @human ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening
* [Re-scope to a senior contractor] @human -> contractor_pivot

=== contractor_pivot ===
Engage a senior contractor for the platform team instead of a staff hire.
-> END

=== panel_interviews ===
Run the panel interview loop with the candidate.
Done when all panel feedback is submitted.
-> debrief

=== debrief ===
Panel debrief: weigh feedback and decide whether to extend an offer.
~ negotiation_rounds = 0
+ [Strong hire, draft an offer] -> offer_approval
+ [No hire, back to the pipeline] ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening

=== offer_approval ===
Eng director reviews the offer terms; no offer goes out without approval.
+ [Director approves, send the offer] @human -> offer_negotiation
+ [Director wants changes, revisit terms] @human ~loop~ -> debrief

=== offer_negotiation ===
Offer is out; candidate responds. Negotiation can run a couple of rounds.
~ negotiation_rounds += 1
+ [Candidate accepts] -> background_check
+ {negotiation_rounds < 2} [Counter-offer, revise terms] ~loop~ -> offer_approval
+ {negotiation_rounds >= 2} [Rounds exhausted, no agreement] ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening
+ [Candidate declines] ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening

=== background_check ===
Run the background check on the accepted candidate.
+ [Check clears] -> start_date_set
+ [Check fails, reopen the search] ~loop~ -> sourcing_and_screening

=== start_date_set ===
Agree a start date and hand off to onboarding. The hire is complete.
-> END
